    "body": "Am I right in thinking that because the mixin is in both places we can just delete the support ElementInternals flag entirely?\n\nThe reflected target will be ElementInternals automatically and it will all *just work*?\n\nI don't know that [Reflect] et al even need any updates?\n\nFrom my reading the support ElementInternals flag seems to be for if you want to do the below and have it automagically apply to ElementInternals?\n\n```webidl\ninterface Element {\n    [Reflect] attribute DOMString fooBar;\n}\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
